{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2114359558227243008"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:19:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116535613222801448"], "id": "2116535613222801448", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 110, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "spaceXAI 工程师 𝗟𝗮𝘂𝗿𝗲𝗻 𝗧𝗮𝗻（前 𝗖𝘂𝗿𝘀𝗼𝗿）挂了条约 1 小时 workshop：从零搭 𝟱𝟬+ 个 𝗚𝗿𝗼𝗸 𝗕𝗼𝘁。  抵市面上千刀的 agentic 课了 \n\n最值钱的数字先说：\n\n1. 𝟵𝟵% 人只用了 𝗚𝗿𝗼𝗸 𝗕𝗼𝘁 能力的 𝟭%。单开一个 Agent，也不跑 /𝗹𝗼𝗼𝗽𝘀 和 /𝗴𝗿𝗮𝗽𝗵𝘀\n\n2. 她自己跑", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116535613222801448"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-31T13:35:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116524457515003984"], "id": "2116524457515003984", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 130, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116510117315166304", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "这套 AI 建站流水线有点牛皮, 一个人想管 13 个 AI 员工做站工厂\n\n找词、PRD、设计、前后端、QA、SEO、增长一路排下去。\n\n真正难的不是让 AI 干活，是上一个人交完的东西，下一个人能不能稳接住。 https://t.co/EuSnqaOx5h", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116524457515003984"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116505752018014208"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:21:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116505894414635273"], "id": "2116505894414635273", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 476, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "万圣节怎么这么多人，简直是人山人海了\n\n带娃吃个饭走出人群都走了半个多小时 https://t.co/6soGEjabk7", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116505894414635273"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-31T11:30:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116492985387131076"], "id": "2116492985387131076", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 280, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116486591283634306", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "哈哈， 已经不止一个人是这个体感\n\nMuse 经常是不知道更新了个啥 \n\n就只是弹出更新 https://t.co/jJd6iydUrY", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116492985387131076"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-31T09:27:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116461927815692324"], "id": "2116461927815692324", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 572, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115761407774118044", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "做视频经常感觉做不到效果，这回有救了，完全直接按 Eian 这篇文章的工作流来操作 https://t.co/QSBbaNTD8h", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116461927815692324"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-31T08:53:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116453371469046254"], "id": "2116453371469046254", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 629, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "想提前体验一下退休生活。\n\n下午躺了二十分钟，没看手机。\n\n起来发现三个未接来电。\n\n他们不同意。", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116453371469046254"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116193285219799040"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-31T08:10:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116442781728244168"], "id": "2116442781728244168", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 761, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Grok Bot 社区把三千多个现成 Bot 收进一个目录，按编码、收件箱、调研、销售、财务、内容、个人事务和整队协作分类，每条带说明，点 Add 就能加，免费。\n\n怎么用：\n\n1. 打开评论里的目录\n2. 选分类和 Bot\n3. 点 Add to Grok Bot\n4. 在聊天里丢第一件事\n\n目录在这：https://t.co/4lmZIeZYhp", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116442781728244168"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-31T07:14:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116428653831815533"], "id": "2116428653831815533", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 695, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116162787873583462", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Grok Bot  官方 郑州、 南京 Meetup 开始报名了 https://t.co/4ZPM1X6VES", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116428653831815533"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-31T05:55:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116408018409808379", "2116408682309431773"], "id": "2116408682309431773", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 478, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116351071752970448", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "聂二亏了四十多万，四条 OPC 坑，数字先摆：\n\n1. 付费学赚钱：被骗 20 万\n别人晒单日收入、包赚钱，学费从 5 万滚到 20 万。付费前先问清有没有真实客户、交付什么、扣完成本剩多少。一直逼补买升级，先止损，别追沉没成本。\n\n2. 合伙干一个多月，到手 2000 https://t.co/fTm60mNDvL", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116408682309431773"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116386858804649984", "3_2116386858804580352"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-31T04:28:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116386869089095812"], "id": "2116386869089095812", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1266, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "尴尬了😅😅😅，英语太差怎么跟外国人交流啊 \n\n我就说了句 where are you from \n\n后面就接不下话了 \n\n主要是听的懂，也不知道怎么用英语回 https://t.co/1t0wVIty9Y", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116386869089095812"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-31T04:11:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116382428076105980"], "id": "2116382428076105980", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 506, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116262141745565826", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "X 开源官方号更新：Under the Hood 现在会直接列出「被限流标签」打中的具体帖子。\n\n入口：https://t.co/sj8jxKgIVv\n\n规则：报告周期内，只有不到 5% 的帖子带这个标签时，才会把具体帖列出来。超过这个比例就不逐条展开。\n\n以前只能感觉到流量不对，现在能对上哪几条被贴了 visibility-limiting https://t.co/uDbR1D2LcY", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116382428076105980"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-31T03:22:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116370262719689144"], "id": "2116370262719689144", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 623, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116337749171360048", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Orange 这篇《AI 泡沫破裂的前夜》，盘面先甩出来：\n\n纳指跌 2.86%，Intel 跌 28.58%（EPS 超预期照样创四十年最大单日跌），谷歌一天蒸发近 5000 亿、跌 12.64%，SanDisk 财报爆表还跌 13%。市场第一反应是 AI 泡沫要破。\n\n他真正问的是：AI 现在到底有没有创造增量价值。 https://t.co/0NZ1gO4EeC", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116370262719689144"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-31T03:10:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116367117163618325"], "id": "2116367117163618325", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 591, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116350440577335353", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "小阳哥这篇讲付费私域，核心就八个字：门槛分流人性，内容碾压群费。\n\n他的观察：\n1. 免费大群最后只剩拼多多和白嫖；加几百块门槛，留下的才是一线干活、互相尊重底牌的人\n2. 真懂行的人买的不是录播课，是群主人脉搭起来的智囊团：工具内测、一手渠道、踩过坑的老玩家随手支招\n3. https://t.co/4BXkjziJ1c", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116367117163618325"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-31T02:23:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116355443304095964"], "id": "2116355443304095964", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 447, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116282740802998627", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "SpaceXAI 这边的 eric zakariasson（前 Cursor）丢了一段给 Grok Bot 的提示词：\n\n让它翻你近两周的邮件、会议、Slack、改过的文档，把重复干过不止一次的活按类型列出来。每条写清：干啥、干了几次、大概多久、能不能代劳、要什么权限。\n\n最后按省时排 Top 3，每条给一条例行或单独 bot。 https://t.co/L4QKCT9Ozr", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116355443304095964"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-31T01:15:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116338316190851145"], "id": "2116338316190851145", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2093, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116323664069284229", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Grok Bot 可以直接买麦当当早餐了 \n\n焚决在下方 https://t.co/Trh6j2eYSd", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116338316190851145"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-31T00:10:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116321916395147668"], "id": "2116321916395147668", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1140, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116220869479428500", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Anthropic 官方号刚改档位名：\n\nMax 5x → Max，$100/月\nMax 20x → Ultra，$200/月\n\n价格没动，老用户不用操作。\n\n真正有用的是第二句：已验证的 Ultra 号，从今天起多数人取消 5 小时限额，只留周限额。新号先卡临时限额，过完验证再松，邮件会通知。\n\n对照现在的定价页：\n1. Max：还是 Pro 的 5 https://t.co/03scxI94aG", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116321916395147668"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T15:01:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116183618746028410"], "id": "2116183618746028410", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 447, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116132839930687687", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "用 Rea 配上本地越狱模型  ,  感觉是无敌了 \n\n一、不用担心被封号 ,  是有说 Claude、Rea 用了 Rea 做逆向被封号了\n\n二、 本地大模型越狱了很多人格问题就少了,   限制也少了 https://t.co/jeVCOPmUTj", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116183618746028410"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116168492135456768"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T14:02:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116168926296256891"], "id": "2116168926296256891", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1146, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116156997712195646", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "AI 看似让人对于掌控感的感觉强上非常多 \n\n实则越是容易通过 AI 来做,  就越容易分心 , 这也是 DAN KOE 情况比以前糟糕 10 倍 \n\n所以到底是人领导 AI ,  还是 AI 反响控制 人 ? https://t.co/NpwTfhRf6v https://t.co/A8mWkR78a7", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116168926296256891"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116153511977365504"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T13:19:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116158060158914975"], "id": "2116158060158914975", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 1337, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "做 Grok Bot 模板站的 XFreeze 演示了一招：换到 Grok Bot，不用从零再讲自己是谁。\n\nSettings 里开 Import Memory，把给的 prompt 贴进你原来的助手，把它回的那段再贴回 Grok Bot，点 Add to Memory。\n\n记忆、偏好、指令、文风、重要上下文一起过来，不用再从头交代一遍。 https://t.co/XyJgeKeYG8", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116158060158914975"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T12:50:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116150217280205308", "2116150666662125925"], "id": "2116150666662125925", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 556, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116114119153627219", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "说过暴论 ! ! !    朝鲜黑客是出海的顶级存在啊啊啊\n\n这一两年盗了 币安、 Bitget 、 Bybit ,  这些加起来都快 100亿美元了\n\n金额早就超过朝鲜的全年 GDP 了吧 ,  这出海创汇是真太牛逼了啊 https://t.co/csVMCE85NP", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116150666662125925"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T11:41:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116133266097090931"], "id": "2116133266097090931", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 466, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116118053872079045", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "FDE 实战案例来了,  美妆客户洗完小红书、抖音数据后，想让 AI 天天自己查：某款精华过去 30 天口碑怎么样、负面集中在哪，最好还能带回原帖。\n\n一句话落到查询，至少得先钉死五件事：查谁、看哪段时间、从哪几个平台取、用什么指标、要不要带证据。少一项，数字再好看也答错题。 https://t.co/FeZR2TRVvE", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116133266097090931"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T10:51:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116120733055369564"], "id": "2116120733055369564", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1759530111534243840", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 621, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116100139878318293", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2115974734957703677", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "https://t.co/wtD1zKnFbK", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116120733055369564"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116099039569854464"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:29:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116100143204520218"], "id": "2116100143204520218", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1759530111534243840", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 273, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116100139878318293", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "还可以可以接着继续追问：\n\n「哪些事项需要我本周检查？请说明判断依据，并保留原邮件入口。」\n\n需要留档，再让它把清单生成表格，导出到本地。\n\nMail Agent 手机端、桌面端都能用。这类查通知、梳理待办的任务，可以先从手机上开始。 https://t.co/JCAum3aFum", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116100143204520218"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "13_2114359558227243008", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2116505752018014208", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2116193285219799040", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2116386858804649984", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116386858804580352", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2116168492135456768", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "13_2116153511977365504", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2116099039569854464", "type": "photo"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2116535613222801448", "next_token": "7140dibdnow9c7btwp0g7a82meyu62jovxk6ewgi70d2w", "oldest_id": "2116100143204520218", "result_count": 23}}